{
  "TanStack Query useInfiniteQuery (JavaScript)": {
    "prefix": [
      "useInfiniteQuery",
      "uiq"
    ],
    "body": [
      "export function ${1:InfiniteUserList}() {",
      "  const ${2:usersQuery} = useInfiniteQuery({",
      "    queryKey: ['${3:users}'],",
      "    initialPageParam: ${4:0},",
      "    queryFn: ({ pageParam, signal }) => ${5:getUsersPage}(pageParam, signal),",
      "    getNextPageParam: (lastPage) => lastPage.nextCursor,",
      "  });",
      "",
      "  return (",
      "    <section aria-label=\"${6:Users}\">",
      "      {${2}.data?.pages.map((page, pageIndex) => (",
      "        <ul key={pageIndex}>",
      "          {page.items.map((item) => <li key={item.id}>{item.name}</li>)}",
      "        </ul>",
      "      ))}",
      "      <button",
      "        type=\"button\"",
      "        onClick={() => void ${2}.fetchNextPage()}",
      "        disabled={!${2}.hasNextPage || ${2}.isFetchingNextPage}",
      "      >",
      "        {${2}.isFetchingNextPage ? 'Loading…' : 'Load more'}",
      "      </button>",
      "      $0",
      "    </section>",
      "  );",
      "}"
    ],
    "description": "Page through an infinite list, including the initialPageParam that TanStack Query 5 requires. Requires useInfiniteQuery from @tanstack/react-query and a page fetcher.\n\n分页加载无限列表，含 TanStack Query 5 必需的 initialPageParam；需要 @tanstack/react-query 的 useInfiniteQuery，以及分页请求函数。",
    "scope": "javascriptreact"
  },
